nt_length": 46, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787535386}, {"pid": 879418787, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 22, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 09:40", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "家人们，大A太可怕了，老庄杀人不眨眼，止小儿夜啼啊[s:ng:哭]", "lou": 102, "content_length": 47, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787535654}, {"pid": 879421975, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 8, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 10:03", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "15分ma365承接住了，感觉能做个底分型出来就机会大于风险", "lou": 103, "content_length": 53, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787537017}, {"pid": 879426252, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 28, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 10:34", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "[E1787538859 0 0]\t", "content": "我本来就是做短套利的，我上周五不是明牌进来吃的套吗，我今天能得吃，不跑才是违背模式，楼里做长的还需要参考我的去留吗？都不是同一个打法", "lou": 104, "content_length": 132, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787538840}, {"pid": 879428463, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 29, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 10:48", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "今天大盘如果破位出量，宝贝们敢动手接吗[s:ac:茶]", "lou": 105, "content_length": 36, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787539717}, {"pid": 879429228, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 42, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 10:53", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879428624,47288722,1330]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=60591384]烛光里的奶妈[/uid] (2026-08-24 10:49):[/b]<br/><br/>真不敢……破位就走了……[/quote]<br/><br/>破位走？？这里缩量横了多久了，今天有高点给你你不走，破位了你走了？<br/><br/>你不敢上就算了，好吧，这里不敢上也是对的，但是你不要给我玩这种低抛高吸的神必战法，你这样很容易变异的", "lou": 106, "content_length": 171, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 879428624, "postdatetimestamp": 1787540020}, {"pid": 879430715, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 42, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 11:03", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "你们现在敢抄底，你们胆子真大<br/><br/>今天能v起来，明天才有诱多的可能性，今天v不起来，那很抱歉，明天就是恐慌踩踏预期，反正机构成本低，赚的少总比格局到最后没得赚好，他们摁地板出也能赚，反正没多头愿意拉，那就无所谓了，看谁跑得快", "lou": 107, "content_length": 216, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787540622}, {"pid": 879431751, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 2, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 11:10", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "鑫王站回56.71之前感觉都是骗炮", "lou": 108, "content_length": 29, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787541021}, {"pid": 879434353, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 14, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 11:25", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "15分底分型都做不出来也太弱了，好歹拉一下吧，都这个位置了", "lou": 109, "content_length": 56, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787541958}, {"pid": 879435174, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 15, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 11:31", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "怎么休市了，休市了我看什么，给我开门", "lou": 110, "content_length": 36, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787542289}, {"pid": 879435391, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 75, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 11:33", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879435181,47288722,1343]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=150058]-阿狼-[/uid] (2026-08-24 11:31):[/b]<br/><br/>还有 关于宏观方面<br/>确认银行存款暂时不会出来了 因为地方化债速度不及预期<br/>所以楼市 股市甚至债市都不会有大行情<br/>这些钱只能在存款和城投债里滚动直到把大部分旧债换成新债<br/><br/>所以你们知道股市为什么上去不行 下来也不行就行了。[/quote]<br/><br/>价值千金的一句话，我居然不用送出去一辆车就能听到[s:ac:哭笑]", "lou": 111, "content_length": 51, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 879435181, "postdatetimestamp": 1787542387}, {"pid": 879447778, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 28, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 13:19", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "目前来看，大盘走成下跌中继了，这才是作为散户最需要防的", "lou": 112, "content_length": 54, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787548746}, {"pid": 879447964, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 36, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 13:20", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "各位看好3864吧，现在你们磕头我也要跟着一起磕，因为市场走烂了是大家都赚不到钱<br/><br/>真他妈的，这垃圾市场", "lou": 113, "content_length": 96, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787548855}, {"pid": 879449498, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 15, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 13:36", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "[E1787549916 0 0]\t", "content": "加速段来了，贪念大起，想吃血筹了，谁来拦一拦我", "lou": 114, "content_length": 46, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787549787}, {"pid": 879453952, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 46, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 14:16", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "我不觉得这里靠跌破3864才放出的量是什么好事情<br/><br/>我觉得这里杀出来的不是恐慌盘，是技术多头的止损盘，靠卖血换来的钱，对身体有好处吗？", "lou": 115, "content_length": 126, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787552161}, {"pid": 879455965, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 39, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 14:33", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "真的有这么变态吗，杀成这样了也就v起来一点，这种纯断头饭的小反弹都要没收掉？他妈的大A比刑场还狠啊，断头饭都不让吃个安生", "lou": 116, "content_length": 118, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787553205}, {"pid": 879459636, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 37, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 15:03", "subject": "", "alterinf